PsioMan 1.2 is an comfortable windows 
file viewer and data manager for the 
four PSION Series (3 and) 3a file types 
(Data, Text, Agenda and Sheet). 
It can edit Agenda and Data files and
act as a link server for 3Link to 
create backup files by the PSION. 
Runs with Windows 3.1 / 3.11 / 95.
